### Requires the application and a configured database
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Three seeded categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Expected: 401 without a login session; see user-api.md for registration/login examples
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Accept: application/json

### Obtain a CSRF token and retain the response cookie before POST/PATCH requests
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json
